title: Status
role: status
is-special: true

# The Desk's Brief. Found BY ROLE (adapter.hubSceneId('status')), never by id.
#
# The old shell does not read this file at all: it renders `status.scene.dry`,
# whose five sub-scenes its five hardcoded tab buttons name directly. The two
# scenes are deliberate duplicates of the same Q data for as long as both UIs
# ship — the old shell is frozen and dies with phase 6, taking `status.scene.dry`
# with it. Drift between them is expected and accepted (user, 2026-07-23); the
# alternative was writing every Brief widget twice.

- @status_new.overview
- @status_new.party
- @status_new.chamber
- @status_new.economy
- @status_new.world
- @status_new.polls
- @library


@overview
title: Overview
role: info-tab

<div class="brief-boxes">
<div class="brief-box"><strong>✦ [+ party_resources +]</strong><span>Party resources</span></div>
<div class="brief-box brief-ghost"><strong>✦ —</strong><span>Govern funds<em>when you govern</em></span></div>
</div>

[? if rubicon: Week [+ week +] ,?][+ month : month +] [+ year +]

[? if player_party != 0 and position_disp != 0: [+ player_party +] [? if player_in_jxsi: (JxSí)?][?if player_in_jxcat: (JxCat)?] position: [+ position_disp +] ?]

<div data-widget="level-bars" data-props='{"deriveFrom":"standing"}'></div>

= The two palaces

<div class="brief-card">
<div class="brief-card-head"><span>Generalitat de Catalunya</span><span>Pl. Sant Jaume</span></div>
<div class="brief-row"><span>Govern</span><span>[+ cat_coalition_disp +]</span></div>
<div class="brief-row"><span>[? if president_gender = "m": President?][? if president_gender = "f": Presidenta?]</span><span>[+ president +] ([+ president_party +])</span></div>
<div class="brief-row"><span>Next election</span><span>[+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +]</span></div>
</div>

<div class="brief-stamp-line"><span>Madrid ⇄ Barcelona</span><span class="brief-stamp">[+ cat_spa_relations : cat_spa_relations +]</span></div>

<div class="brief-card">
<div class="brief-card-head"><span>Gobierno de España</span><span>La Moncloa</span></div>
<div class="brief-row"><span>Gobierno</span><span>[+ spanish_coalition_disp +]</span></div>
<div class="brief-row"><span>[? if spanish_pm_gender = "m": Presidente?][? if spanish_pm_gender = "f": Presidenta?]</span><span>[+ spanish_pm +] ([? if spanish_pm_party == "cs" : csspa?][? if spanish_pm_party != "cs": [+ spanish_pm_party +]?])</span></div>
<div class="brief-row"><span>Next election</span><span>[+ next_spanish_election_month : month +] [+ next_spanish_election_year +]</span></div>
</div>

= The map

[? if not historical_mode: <div id="cat-polls-widget" data-widget="poll-map" data-props='{"variant":"compact"}'></div>?][? if historical_mode: <div id="cat-polls-widget" data-widget="poll-map" data-props='{"variant":"blank"}'></div>?]


@party
title: Party
role: info-tab

<div class="brief-box brief-ghost"><span class="brief-stamp">[? if player_party = "erc": [+ erc_roadmap : roadmap +]?][? if player_party = "jxsi": [+ jxsi_roadmap : roadmap +]?][? if player_party = "ciu": [+ ciu_roadmap : roadmap +]?][? if player_party = "cup": [+ cup_roadmap : roadmap +]?][? if player_party=None: [+ player_party : roadmap +]?]</span><span>Roadmap[? if roadmap_year: · [+ roadmap_year +]?]</span></div>

[? if player_party == "erc": Internal dissent: [+ erc_dissent : dissent +]?][? if player_party == "cup": Internal dissent: [+ cup_dissent : dissent +]?]

= The factions

<div data-widget="tension-rows" data-props='{"deriveFrom":"factions"}'></div>

= The street

<div data-widget="level-bars" data-props='{"deriveFrom":"street"}'></div>

<div style="font-size:0.85em;"> Currently [+ independence_trust : politics_trust +] the government.</div>


@chamber
title: Chamber
role: info-tab

<div data-widget="seat-bars" data-props='{"deriveFrom":"composition"}'></div>

Speaker of the House — [+ speaker +] ([+ speaker_party +])

= The benches

<div data-widget="roster-rows" data-props='{"deriveFrom":"benches"}'></div>

= El Govern

<div data-widget="leader-rows" data-props='{"deriveFrom":"cabinet"}'></div>

[? if cat_coalition_dissent != 0 : Coalition dissent: [+ cat_coalition_dissent : dissent +] ?]


@economy
title: Economy
role: info-tab

<div data-widget="trail" data-props='{"deriveFrom":"trails"}'></div>

<div class="brief-row"><span>Debt status</span><span class="brief-stamp">[+ public_debt : public_debt_qualifier +]</span></div>


@world
title: World
role: info-tab

= Madrid

Tensions: [+ cat_spa_relations : cat_spa_relations +]

= The chancelleries

<div data-widget="roster-rows" data-props='{"deriveFrom":"chancelleries"}'></div>

= State control

<div data-widget="leader-rows" data-props='{"deriveFrom":"control"}'></div>


@polls
title: Polls
role: info-tab
view-if: not historical_mode

<div class="brief-note">Per-province results, if the elections were held today.</div>

<div id="cat-polls-widget" data-widget="poll-map"></div>

= Street sentiment

Social dissent: [+ social_dissent : social_dissent +]

Independence movement momentum: [+ independence_movement : independence_movement +]
